e_name": "05_Faces_Selector_2560x1440.png", "id": "1288337783335827", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831299_1288337786669160_4475558771986816353_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=m_CEjQahwdoQ7kNvwFz9pGN&_nc_oc=Adr_gMUwIQhUzKTs265lZ-BioG-hYf0Nl5HlVMKs7xOmnoyueS6JoQ-xiHlJQSXcjjs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOhTVPEcJC0N_VyFz6bK2UF-tRmAdXHyOg5M-3f4BkrBQ&oe=6AD25A6D"}, {"file_name": "01_Barker_Neutral_2560x1440.png", "id": "1821110108888468", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491830441_1821110112221801_8561623093088699699_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=T910tPTzFwsQ7kNvwEtERbf&_nc_oc=AdromP9VnosxGlqR28XJTsCCGNU0Y5gOuttfnEOaML-TS-XLlJlksGxb5Ql4FWSRxvk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQM2u_yG-FZYWJ_LgE17WRYKPyJFm_5DWVHut4XRHSEJPQ&oe=6AD250CF"}, {"file_name": "03_Barker_Action_2560x1440.png", "id": "2620587385039026", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/585799753_2620587388372359_8557321908904764527_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=QxNfn9Lb-OcQ7kNvwFYmkId&_nc_oc=Adpy6gRTYKKg7SHSdemb5nIeuDEMUbPXxSbm_ZAmFAs7h1EPCr2I5flfWiMSQDMntf0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOQqCIOARhEQlx6DbDkqk4cAZNc-pfXWj9ztMsYOH2SJg&oe=6AD2547C"}, {"file_name": "02_Flexer_Neutral_2560x1440.png", "id": "3167831576755462", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831299_3167831580088795_7645227145100028470_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vRZgwkibPZkQ7kNvwFJQWW3&_nc_oc=AdqAhVgy5mKHYy_a_GTk2SmXBnksCUrdMOKwwwek9pESsu24fo_ZHUSYc10uQsUhFMI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMZjRO9HW-9pkI9tklCCnQWw7uz2_Ngr7AbGC4ylruUMg&oe=6AD2264C"}, {"file_name": "04_Flexer_Action_2560x1440.png", "id": "2184872072072152", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831299_2184872075405485_4008272742366392584_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=a0uRBy36N6EQ7kNvwHSBoZ-&_nc_oc=AdqiF0AC1leHwkvu-TQx7XR-JviGPkpepOgc-dQu-0R0Xyx2R7CNNUfSQBfzkfPHGKc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOUJidz1tErmo4eR0FPwTbK-Lpuh16sBI3-uY3vhvDhcw&oe=6AD24F93"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Punchable Face", "keywords": ["boxing", "punching", "arcade", "stress", "fitness"], "long_description": "Sometimes you just want to punch a face.\n\n**Punchable Face** is a simple VR stress toy built around one idea: choose an irritating character, step into their world, and go to town.\n\n## Choose Your Face\n\n### The Barker\nA grinning carnival loudmouth waiting for you under the lights.\n\n### The Flexer\nA smug car-meet regular surrounded by modified cars and nighttime parking-lot lights.\n\n## Hit Harder\n\nEvery valid punch is measured using your controller speed and converted into an **Impact Score from 100 to 999**.\n\nChase your Session Best and watch each character react with movement, haptics, impact audio, facial reactions, and accumulating redness that slowly fades when you stop.\n\n## Features\n\n- Two characters with unique environments\n- Physics-based punch detection\n- Impact Score and Session Best\n- Hand-specific haptics\n- Reactive faces and visual feedback\n- Standing or seated play\n- No locomotion, rounds, health bars, or complicated progression\n\n**Pick a face. Punch it.**", "short_description": "Pick an annoying face, put on your gloves, and start swinging. Punchable Face is a simple VR stress toy with satisfying impacts, haptics, scoring, and two ridiculous characters to pummel."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.stormxr.tech/privacy-policy/punchable-face", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "StormXR LLC", "support_website_url": "https://www.stormxr.tech/contact", "website_url": "https://www.stormxr.tech/development", "category": n